    "details": "<p><strong>Event Description</strong></p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"227\">OVERCLOCK&rsquo;26 &ndash; 24-Hour Hackathon</strong> is a flagship hackathon organized by the <strong data-start=\"269\" data-end=\"364\">Department of Information Technology &amp; TechSaavy Club, Easwari Engineering College, Chennai</strong>.</p>\n<p>Participants will work in teams to identify problems, build innovative technology-driven solutions, and present their working prototypes within a <strong data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"767\">24-hour development sprint</strong>.</p>\n<p>Whether you're passionate about coding, AI, web development, app development, design, hardware, or simply have an idea worth building &mdash; <strong data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"963\">OverClock&rsquo;26 is the platform to turn it into reality.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"974\">Date:</strong> October 30&ndash;31, 2026</li>\n<li><strong data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1010\">Duration:</strong> 24 Hours</li>\n<li><strong data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1036\">Team Size:</strong> 1&ndash;4 members</li>\n<li><strong data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1060\">Mode:</strong> Offline</li>\n<li><strong data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1081\">Venue:</strong> Easwari Engineering College, Chennai</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1158\">Push the Limits. Build the Future.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Event Overview:</strong></p>\n<p>OverClock&rsquo;26 is designed to provide participants with a competitive environment to <strong data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1313\">innovate, collaborate, build, and showcase</strong> their technical skills.</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"138\">Team Formation:</strong> Teams can consist of 4 members. Participants may form teams within their own college/department or collaborate with participants from other colleges and departments. <strong data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"384\">Inter-college and cross-department teams are permitted but not mandatory.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Projects will be evaluated based on factors such as:</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1824\">\n<li data-section-id=\"11svlge\" data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1675\">Innovation &amp; Originality</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"aotpnt\" data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1706\">Technical Implementation</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1m1wun6\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1730\">Problem Relevance</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12izfwj\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1750\">Functionality</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"82scav\" data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1772\">User Experience</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ckiour\" data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1799\">Impact &amp; Scalability</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"i18kr6\" data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1824\">Final Presentation</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Participants will also get an opportunity to interact with fellow innovators and gain practical experience working under real hackathon constraints.</p>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; Guidelines:</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"3390\">\n<li data-section-id=\"m2ph2o\" data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2082\"><strong data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2021\">Team Size:</strong> Each team must have a minimum of 1 and maximum of 4 members.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1io0kgt\" data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2172\"><strong data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2102\">Eligibility:</strong> Students from any college/institution and department can participate.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lw74ny\" data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2256\"><strong data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2200\">Inter-College Teams:</strong> Cross-college and cross-department teams are permitted.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"k7lade\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2351\"><strong data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2276\">Originality:</strong> All submissions must be original work developed by the participating team.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1gn5v8w\" data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2476\"><strong data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2378\">Development Window:</strong> The core development of the project must take place within the official 24-hour hackathon period.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"r6vrwp\" data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2649\"><strong data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2506\">Open-Source Resources:</strong> Participants may use publicly available libraries, APIs, frameworks, and documentation. Any major external resources used should be disclosed.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"164zt3c\" data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2792\"><strong data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2668\">Plagiarism:</strong> Plagiarism, copied projects, or submission of previously developed projects as original work will lead to disqualification.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"l8plwg\" data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2906\"><strong data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2811\">Submission:</strong> Teams must submit their project and required documentation/demo within the announced deadline.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1req6xr\" data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"3025\"><strong data-start=\"2910\" data-end=\"2924\">Equipment:</strong> Participants are responsible for bringing their own laptops, chargers, extension box and other required equipment.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1mjn6rs\" data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3167\"><strong data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3042\">Conduct:</strong> Participants must follow the instructions of the organizing committee and maintain appropriate conduct throughout the event.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"4s4xpp\" data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3258\"><strong data-start=\"3172\" data-end=\"3184\">Judging:</strong> The decision of the judging panel and organizing committee will be final and binding.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lafrqb\" data-start=\"3259\" data-end=\"3390\"><strong data-start=\"3263\" data-end=\"3275\">Updates:</strong> Any changes to the schedule or event guidelines will be communicated to registered participants by the organizers.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Important Dates</strong></p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"3413\" data-end=\"3437\">Registration Closes:</strong> October 29, 2026<br data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3504\" /><strong data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3518\">Hackathon:</strong> October 30&ndash;31, 2026</p>",
    "end_date": "2026-10-29T10:00:00+05:30",
